---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Patterns
description: Generated multi-component patterns for the Aihio design system.
---
<section class="docs-page-intro">
  <div class="docs-eyebrow">
    <aihio-badge>Pattern library</aihio-badge>
    <aihio-badge variant="outline">{{ docs.patternCount }} patterns</aihio-badge>
  </div>
  <h1>Patterns</h1>
  <p>
    Patterns document a composition rather than a single component: which components take part, how they nest, and what
    the authored markup looks like. They come from the same schema bundle that powers linting and prompt output.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="docs-component-grid">
    {% for pattern in docs.patterns %}
      <article class="docs-component-card">
        <div class="docs-component-card__body">
          <h3 class="docs-component-card__title">
            <a href="{{ pattern.path | docsUrl(page.url) }}">{{ pattern.name }}</a>
          </h3>
          <p class="docs-component-card__description">{{ pattern.description | prose | safe }}</p>
          <p class="docs-component-card__meta">{{ pattern.componentEntries.length }} components · <code>{{ pattern.id }}</code></p>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
